@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.44.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.44.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.44.0 (2026-11-25): The exam results story for the other chapters is done."""@en .

ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Tool backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "page_retrofit_exam 1.0.0 applies template patch 9.54.0 to a built page, sets the next minor page version in the version marks and copies the page data and manifest to that version. It prints the changed line blocks: 22 in each page, all in the exam parts, the CSS, the tab list, the About line and the version marks." .
ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Pages backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "18 pages retrofitted (chapters 1 to 9 and 12 to 20), each a new minor version; the previous versions stay. Chapters 21 to 25 excluded as stated in 1.41.0." .
ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Honest note: the full page test 9.41.0 was tried first on chapter 1 and failed on things unrelated to the exam (older story labels and a mobile step), because it expects the newest template; the older full test versions assert the release lock that was removed. So the focused exam results test 1.0.0 (18 checks: two tabs, no lock, result at once, retake, refusal over an open exam, read-only review, reload, result file, PDF, hand-in zip and audit log, accessibility, clear, no script errors) was run on all 20 pages, chapters 10 and 11 included: 20 of 20 pass, logs kept per page. The full tests of chapters 10 and 11 (410 and 414 passed) stand from 1.40.0. The other 18 pages did not get a full-suite run, which is a gap against the usual practice; the diff of each page against its previous version is confined to the exam parts." .
ex:ST11_ExamResultsAll backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Criterion met, with the verification gap named in the verify task." .
